I have an idea that could possibly help you solve your problem, by using a python dictionary.
A Python dictionary is a mapping between string and values. 
That is you can say "What state capitals contain the letter i?" and get the answer as a tuple - the map from the values to a tuple of the keys.
Once you have this map, just iterate through the keys and get the corresponding values.
